      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَشْوٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِق</span> [generally meaning the <i>fruit of
the lote-tree called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِدْر</span>; but sometimes the <i>tree
thus called itself</i>]: (K:) accord to the M, [the
n. un.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَشْوَةٌ</span> signifies <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِدْرَة</span>. (TA.)

